    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Multi-Primary Coordinator</para>
<para>Coordinates multiple primary nodes without traditional leader election. Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Multiple primaries accept writes simultaneously</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Conflict resolution via Last-Write-Wins (timestamp-based)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cross-primary replication for eventual consistency</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Manual promotion on primary failure (no automatic election) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
